#: main.cpp:29
msgid ""
"An application to generate publication-ready figures. It is a KDE frontend "
"for Circuit Macros by J. D. Aplevich, TikZ and Gnuplot. <p>Visit the <a "
"href=http://www.ece.uwaterloo.ca/~aplevich/Circuit_macros>Circuit Macros</a> "
"and <a href=http://www.texample.net/tikz>TikZ</a> websites for further "
"information."
